lseAudio-compatible audio device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Linux with Vulkan 1.0 support.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660 / RX 580 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> PipeWire or PulseAudio-compatible audio device</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["The Occult Arcade"], "publishers": ["The Occult Arcade"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889800/608b1e981d0495d67747cd8dc5f07031ba0ff589/ss_608b1e981d0495d67747cd8dc5f07031ba0ff589.600x338.jpg?t=1787919790", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889800/608b1e981d0495d67747cd8dc5f07031ba0ff589/ss_608b1e981d0495d67747cd8dc5f07031ba0ff589.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787919790"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889800/b128f82746d85569d57d138bcb6d78d534169e0f/ss_b128f82746d85569d57d138bcb6d78d534169e0f.600x338.jpg?t=1787919790", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889800/b128f82746d85569d57d138bcb6d78d534169e0f/ss_b128f82746d85569d57d138bcb6d78d534169e0f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787919790"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889800/663301b607fd045a791f09c5b6a49649cbde4d87/ss_663301b607fd045a791f09c5b6a